%% Title: MediSearch Web Scraping to Storage Flow
flowchart LR
  Sources[Chefaa, Gardenia, Bloom, Al Dawaa Pharmacy Sites] --> Fetch[HTTP Fetch with Delay, Timeout, Retries]
  Fetch --> ParseList[Parse Category Product Cards]
  ParseList --> ParseDetail[Parse Product Details, Brand, Category, Availability]
  ParseDetail --> Translate[Generate English Name When Needed]
  Translate --> JSON[Write Structured JSON / CSV]
  JSON --> Raw[Backblaze B2 Raw Data Storage]
  Raw --> Cleaning[Cleaning Pipeline]
  Cleaning --> Staging[Backblaze B2 Staging Storage]
